WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.200
He must intend for me to inherit the throne.

00:04.080 --> 00:07.360
So it is then I'll become the emperor's brother-in-law.

00:08.320 --> 00:14.200
What about me? Me you you'll be General Zhu good, good.

00:14.880 --> 00:17.240
Leave tonight delay invites trouble.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.760
Traveling light and riding through the night, you soon hastened back to the Imperial City.

00:22.840 --> 00:25.640
Increase that grain production.

00:26.320 --> 00:29.120
Good the world will be ours.

00:34.480 --> 00:35.880
Thank you, General.

00:38.000 --> 00:39.720
You only brought two people back?

00:39.880 --> 00:41.280
What else?

00:41.360 --> 00:43.160
I was afraid I wouldn't have time to find you when I returned.

00:43.240 --> 00:44.520
General Chen.

00:44.600 --> 00:46.520
I brought you a gift.

00:53.880 --> 00:59.640
Xie Xuan you're asking for death my brother-in-law's great plan is about to succeed not only will I slap you.

00:59.720 --> 01:01.720
I'll also kick you to death.

01:05.240 --> 01:06.640
Guards.

01:10.080 --> 01:16.080
Don't take them to the crown prince kill them now I'd like to see who dares.

01:16.880 --> 01:21.960
Bury them alive drown them chop them up and feed them to dogs.

